  "reference": "Kūkundūlīlwa 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū malaika wa katanò ūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe; nūbona Sonda yika kūfuma ng'wigūlū, yinhwa lūfungūlo lwa h'ishimayenze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūlīkundūla ī lishimayenze lyenīlo, lyūfuma mo lyochi līlīdundumūka gītī līlīfuma h'ibībī itaale; pyī ū ng'wilunde hūbilūhīja kūlwa nguno ya lyochi īlo līkafuma ng'wichongo lyenīlo, nī līīmi lyūhīndīhajiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mu lyochi lyenīlo jūfuma mo njige, jiza ha sī; jalī jinhwa būdūla gītī būdūla bo ng'homi ja ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo jalī jalemejiwa ū kūgakuumya a maswa ga ha sī, nūūlū shikolo shose shose ī shidoto, yaya nūūlū ntī gose gose, ūlū ītī banhū dūhū, abo batī na lūmeng'ho lwa ng'wa Mulungu kū būshū wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo hangī jalī jalemejiwa ū kūbabūlaga, alīyo jibaluhye dūhū ikanza lya myeji ītanò. Ū būsūngū wajo walī gītī būsūngū bo ng'homi ūlū yūnuma munhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mu shikū jenījo a banhū bakūyūlīkooba ī licha, alīyo batūlīpandīka, bakūlwikūmva no ū lūfu, alīyo lūkūyūbapeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī njige jenījo jaali gītī falasa jimalīīlile kūja mu būlūgū; ū kū mitwe yajo jalī jitūūlīkījiwe shikolo sha kūbiza gītī ngikili ja zahabu, ū būshū wajo walī gītī būshū wa banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalī na booya gītī nzwīlī ja bakīma, a mino gajo gaalī gītī ga shimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha shikuba jalī n'ibbapala lya kūbiza gītī lūmūda lwa chūma. Ū ng'huutumo gwa manana gajo gwalī gītī nundumo gwa magogoteni mingī ga falasa jilīpeelanya kūja kū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī jalī na mikīla ya lūboola gītī lo ng'homi; ū būdūla bo kūbaluhya a banhū ū mu myeji īy'ītanò yenīyo boolī kū mikīla yajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalī na ntemi wajo ūyo walī malaika wa ng'wishimayenze; ī lina lyakwe ū mu Shihebulania witanagwa Abadoni, ū mu Shiyunani Apolioni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Apolioni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho nyagaja.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbiza bobīta būluhiwa būmò, alīyo a ha numa yaho boolī būtaalī wiza būngī būbīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū malaika wa katandatū ūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe; niigwa ilaka kūfuma a ha mapembe ane ga ng'walīlo gwa zahabu, ūyo gūlī kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika wa katandatū ūyo walī n'ipembe lyūng'wīla ī lilaka lyenīlo gīkī, “Balekelage a bamalaika a bane, abo batungilwe kū līmongo, ī Līfulati.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana būlekelwa a bamalaika benabo, abo baalī batūūlwa ho kūshisha līshike ī likanza nū lūshikū, nū ng'weji nū ng'waka, gīkī babūlage selusi īmò ya banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būkūmi wa bashilikale ba kūdamhīla falasa walī shihūmbī magana abīlī ng'hangala shihūmbī, h'ūmo nakigwīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mūkolochiwa kwajo ī falasa na a badamhīji bajo, ūmo nakabonela ū mu koolekejiwa kwane, kwalī gīkī, ū kū shikuba baalī na mūda ja chūma ja būza būbalalūku gītī bo moto na bo manjaano. Ī mitwe ya falasa jenījo yalī gītī ya shimba, ū mu nomo jafuupaga moto na lyochi na būgota bo shibiliti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selusi īmò ya banhū yūshila kūbūlagwa nī shikolo ī shidatū shenīsho, ū moto nī lyochi nū būgota bo shibiliti, īsho shafumaga ū mu falasa jenījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būdūla wajo ī falasa jenījo būlī mu milomo na kū mikīla yajo. Ī mikīla yenīyo jikītūmamīlaga kūyagaja, nguno īlī na mitwe gītī ya nzoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū abo bakasaaga ho, abo batabūlagilwe nī shikolo shenīsho, batagalūkile na koya ī milīmo ya makono gabo. Batooyile ū kūgalamya a masamva nī shikolo ī shingī ī sha zahabu na feza na chūma, na mawe na mantī; shikolo īsho shitabonaga nūūlū kwigwa, hangī shitīko nūūlū kūshimīza! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī batagalūkile gīkī balekane nū būbūlagi wabo, pyī nū būlogi, nū būjingi, nū wibi wabo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
